{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type AgentLoopStrategy = (state) => boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1109","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1109"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Strategy function that determines whether the agent loop should continue"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"state","children":[{"type":"text","value":"state"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/AgentLoopState.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AgentLoopState"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Current state of the agent loop"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"true to continue looping, false to stop"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// Continue for up to 5 iterations (model turns, not tool calls)\nconst strategy: AgentLoopStrategy = ({ iterationCount }) => iterationCount < 5;\n// Cap total tool calls across the run (or use middleware onShouldContinue)\nconst byTools: AgentLoopStrategy = ({ toolCallCount }) => toolCallCount < 20;","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"state","text":"state","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype AgentLoopStrategy = (state) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1109](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1109)\n\nStrategy function that determines whether the agent loop should continue\n\n## Parameters\n\n### state\n\n[`AgentLoopState`](../interfaces/AgentLoopState.md)\n\nCurrent state of the agent loop\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\ntrue to continue looping, false to stop\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\n// Continue for up to 5 iterations (model turns, not tool calls)\nconst strategy: AgentLoopStrategy = ({ iterationCount }) => iterationCount < 5;\n// Cap total tool calls across the run (or use middleware onShouldContinue)\nconst byTools: AgentLoopStrategy = ({ toolCallCount }) => toolCallCount < 20;\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AgentLoopStrategy\ntitle: AgentLoopStrategy\n---\n\n```ts\ntype AgentLoopStrategy = (state) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1109](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1109)\n\nStrategy function that determines whether the agent loop should continue\n\n## Parameters\n\n### state\n\n[`AgentLoopState`](../interfaces/AgentLoopState.md)\n\nCurrent state of the agent loop\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\ntrue to continue looping, false to stop\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\n// Continue for up to 5 iterations (model turns, not tool calls)\nconst strategy: AgentLoopStrategy = ({ iterationCount }) => iterationCount < 5;\n// Cap total tool calls across the run (or use middleware onShouldContinue)\nconst byTools: AgentLoopStrategy = ({ toolCallCount }) => toolCallCount < 20;\n```\n"}
